# Better the Demon You Know (otherAreas 105): Koblakiq's reply kinds. Oldton Movalpolos' Koblakiq has no script (no
# fallback turn) and the default event 13; Missionary Moblin, For the Birds and Better share him, and the container
# order of their ties is Better_The_Demon_You_Know < For_The_Birds < Missionary_Moblin (a tie plays Better's first, then
# cycles). So each of Better's replies is shown against Missionary's 7 (Progress, Missionary available) and 8 / 12
# (Event, Missionary accepted / completed with its mustZone): a Progress ties with 7 and plays first (an Event there
# would lose to 7); an Event at priority 101 loses to 7 and beats 8 / 12 on every talk (at 100 it would tie with them
# and cycle: the second talk would play theirs; at Progress it would beat 7); 27 (replaceDefault, 20) loses to 8.
# For the Birds completed (no mustZone), Better available. Talk 1: 20 and 7: 20, finished: begun. Prog 0: 21 loses to
# 7. Missionary accepted (a GM): 21, twice. The Soiled Letter and a Demon Pen traded: 22 and 9 (Progress): a tie: 22,
# finished: the pen and the letter taken (each handler's tradeHas confirmed its item), Prog 1, Wait now + 60. The two
# again (GMs): the cycle: 9, finished: Missionary completed, its mustZone set. Prog 1, the wait not over: 23 beats 12,
# twice. Missionary available (a GM): 7 beats 23. The wait over (Wait now, a GM): 24 and 7: 24, finished: Prog 2. 7
# beats 25. Missionary accepted (a GM): 25 beats 8, twice. Prog 3 (a GM), Missionary available (a GM): 26 and 7: 26,
# finished: completed. Missionary accepted (a GM): 27 loses to 8.
lists OldtonMovalpolos/Koblakiq/onTrigger OldtonMovalpolos/Koblakiq/onTrade OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/7 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/9 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/20 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/22 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/24 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/26
char zone=OldtonMovalpolos pos=-63.4,22.8,-117.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.ForTheBirds completed
item SoiledLetter
item DemonPen
login
trigger Koblakiq                        # Better available: 20 and Missionary's 7 (both Progress): a tie: 20
finish                                  # Better begun
trigger Koblakiq                        # Prog 0: 21 (101) loses to 7 (Progress): 7
finish option=0                         # nothing
quest OtherAreas.MissionaryMoblin accepted # a GM
trigger Koblakiq                        # 21 (101) beats 8 (Event): 21
finish
trigger Koblakiq                        # 21 again (no tie, no cycle)
finish
trade Koblakiq SoiledLetter x1 DemonPen x1 # 22 and 9 (both Progress): a tie: 22
finish                                  # the pen and the letter taken; Prog 1; Wait now + 60
item SoiledLetter                       # a GM
item DemonPen                           # a GM
trade Koblakiq SoiledLetter x1 DemonPen x1 # the tie's cycle: 9
finish                                  # Missionary completed (4000 gil); the letter and the pen taken; its mustZone 11
trigger Koblakiq                        # Prog 1, the wait not over: 23 (101) beats Missionary's 12 (Event): 23
finish
trigger Koblakiq                        # 23 again
finish
quest OtherAreas.MissionaryMoblin available # a GM
trigger Koblakiq                        # 23 (101) loses to 7: 7
finish option=0                         # nothing
charvar Quest[4][105]Wait 1800000000    # a GM: now
trigger Koblakiq                        # the wait over: 24 and 7 (both Progress): a tie: 24
finish                                  # Prog 2
trigger Koblakiq                        # Prog 2: 25 (101) loses to 7: 7
finish option=0                         # nothing
quest OtherAreas.MissionaryMoblin accepted # a GM
trigger Koblakiq                        # 25 (101) beats 8: 25
finish
trigger Koblakiq                        # 25 again
finish
charvar Quest[4][105]Prog 3             # a GM
quest OtherAreas.MissionaryMoblin available # a GM
trigger Koblakiq                        # Prog 3: 26 and 7 (both Progress): a tie: 26
finish                                  # Better completed (Goblin Grenade, Apostate for Hire)
quest OtherAreas.MissionaryMoblin accepted # a GM
trigger Koblakiq                        # completed: 27 (replaceDefault) loses to 8 (Event): 8
finish
